    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are trained in Republic military fighting techniques, giving you an advantage in ranged combat. This training is generally given to members of the Republic military forces.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> Once per encounter, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>, you gain <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a> 10 against an incoming attack if you have <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cover\" title=\"Cover\">Cover</a> from the attacker. You can gain the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a> as long as you have <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cover\" title=\"Cover\">Cover</a>, even if your opponent uses <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Aim\" title=\"Aim\">Aim</a> to ignore your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cover\" title=\"Cover\">Cover</a> bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>.</p>",
